<title>JAPAN: Hakuto to issue 392 mln yen warrant bonds.</title>
<headline>Hakuto to issue 392 mln yen warrant bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BORROWER - Hakuto Co Ltd</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nikko Securities</p>
<p> TYPE domestic warrant  ISSUE NO  1	   AMT   392 million yen</p>
<p> COUPON  0.5 pct	  ISS PRICE 100 yen   MATURITY 28.Mar.01</p>
<p> EXERCISE FRM 1.May.97  EXERCISE TO 27.Mar.01</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	     PAY DATE 28.Mar.97  INT PAY 28.Mar/Sept</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		   SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 13-27 Mar</p>
<p> LAST JCR		   LAST JBRI	     LAST NIS</p>
</text>
